# NixOS + direnv

- Run Node, pnpm, and Prisma commands inside the project shell (`direnv` + `shell.nix`). Do not use Cursor-bundled or system Node.
- After changing `.envrc`, run `direnv allow`.
- Secrets live in `.env` (gitignored). `.envrc` loads them with `dotenv_if_exists .env`.
- Postgres (`notification_hub`) and Redis come from shared Infra on `localhost:5432` / `localhost:6379`. Use `docker-compose.yml` only when Infra is not running.
- After each completed task in `docs/plan.md`, mark the checkbox and keep notes in the same file.
